# Pairs with DeleteFence. A publish of the id does not wait for an operator
# delete's lease, so it runs while the delete is deleting artifacts.
MODULE: DeleteFenceAcquireIgnoresLease
TARGET: DeleteFence
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a publish takes the hold while a delete's lease is live
PERTURBS: Acquire

--- FIND
       /\ s = "A" => ~Leased
--- REPLACE
       \* MUTATION: the publish ignores delete leases.
       /\ TRUE
--- END
